    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The RDF Serializer code is just few brief Camel routes:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/fcrepo-serialization/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/serialization/SerializationRouter.java"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/fcrepo-serialization/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/serialization/SerializationRouter.java",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "For example, the route to serialize metadata is:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "language": "java"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "from(\"direct:metadata\")\r\n    .routeId(\"FcrepoSerializationMetadataUpdater\")\r\n    .to(\"fcrepo:{{fcrepo.baseUrl}}?accept={{serialization.mimeType}}\")\r\n    .log(INFO, LOGGER,\r\n            \"Serializing object ${headers[CamelFcrepoIdentifier]}\")\r\n    .setHeader(FILE_NAME)\r\n        .simple(\"${headers[CamelFcrepoIdentifier]}.{{serialization.extension}}\")\r\n    .log(DEBUG, LOGGER, \"filename is ${headers[CamelFileName]}\")\r\n    .to(\"file://{{serialization.descriptions}}\");",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "So I don't think we can import or copy this code, but it's still useful for documenting the serialization format.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
