      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The RDF Serializer code is just few brief Camel routes:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/fcrepo-serialization/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/serialization/SerializationRouter.java\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/blob/master/fcrepo-serialization/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/camel/serialization/SerializationRouter.java</a></p>\n\n<p>For example, the route to serialize metadata is:</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nfrom(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"direct:metadata\"</span>)\r\n    .routeId(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"FcrepoSerializationMetadataUpdater\"</span>)\r\n    .to(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"fcrepo:{{fcrepo.baseUrl}}?accept={{serialization.mimeType}}\"</span>)\r\n    .log(INFO, LOGGER,\r\n            <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Serializing object ${headers[CamelFcrepoIdentifier]}\"</span>)\r\n    .setHeader(FILE_NAME)\r\n        .simple(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"${headers[CamelFcrepoIdentifier]}.{{serialization.extension}}\"</span>)\r\n    .log(DEBUG, LOGGER, <span class=\"code-quote\">\"filename is ${headers[CamelFileName]}\"</span>)\r\n    .to(<span class=\"code-quote\">\"file:<span class=\"code-comment\">//{{serialization.descriptions}}\"</span>);</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>So I don't think we can import or copy this code, but it's still useful for documenting the serialization format.</p>",
     "created": "29/Aug/16 4:46 PM",
     "id": "17289",
     "jsdPublic": true,
